MODULE 22: LIBRARY MANAGEMENT AND DIGITAL LIBRARY PORTAL
HI-TECH College Integrated Digital Academic & Certification Platform
Module specification Physical and digital library

The Library Management Portal manages physical books, e-books, journals, research materials, borrowing, returns, reservations, library access, fines, digital reading and library resources.

It integrates with the Student Portal, Staff Portal, Lecturer Portal, Registrar Portal, Finance Portal, Examination Portal and Administration Portal.

