6. Important integration notes
The current code provides the dashboard interface and local interactions. The following are demonstration data and still need backend integration:

Dashboard feature

Required integration

Student profile

GET /api/students/me

Academic overview

GET /api/students/me/academic-summary

Timetable

GET /api/students/me/timetable

Course registration

/api/academic/unit-enrollments

Results

GET /api/students/me/results

Fee balance

GET /api/finance/students/me/statement

Notifications

/api/notifications

Upcoming events

/api/events

Student documents

/api/documents

Student support

/api/support/tickets

Important: The fee balance, GPA, attendance, notifications and events currently contain sample values. They must be replaced with authenticated API data before deployment. The navigation callback is ready to connect to your React Router routes.

The next development step should be connecting this dashboard to the actual student account, so each student sees their own registration number, programme, units, attendance, results, fee statement and timetable rather than demonstration information.


